# Courier Management System (CMS)

## Project status

**Proposed solution — implementation has not started.**

This repository documents the planned Salesforce-based Courier Management System. It does not yet contain a deployed application, implemented Salesforce configuration, or verified test results.

## Proposed solution

Develop a cloud-based Courier Management System in Salesforce to automate shipment booking, tracking, delivery-agent assignment, status updates, and reports and dashboards.

## Business objectives

- Manage customers and shipments.
- Track parcel movement.
- Assign delivery agents.
- Keep shipment status up to date.
- Provide analytics dashboards for delivery operations.

## Planned features

| Feature | Intended purpose |
| --- | --- |
| Shipment booking | Record shipment and delivery details. |
| Tracking | Maintain visibility of each parcel's progress. |
| Delivery-agent assignment | Assign responsibility for delivering shipments. |
| Status updates | Record progress through the shipment lifecycle. |
| Reports and dashboards | Summarize shipment activity and delivery performance. |

The course description calls for real-time status updates. The update mechanism and refresh behavior will be defined during implementation. Live GPS tracking is not specified in the supplied requirements.

