## Illustrative business workflow

Customer and shipment details recorded → delivery agent assigned → tracking and status updated → delivery outcome recorded → reports reviewed.

This workflow is a proposal. Exact record names, fields, assignment rules, shipment statuses, permissions, and acceptance criteria remain to be agreed with the course requirements.

